; Room 55 ($37): West Bedroom
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: cyan (5). Conveyor: moves Willy left, 3 cells from row 3 column 26.
; Ramp: none.
; .
; Items: none in the item table.
; .
; Exits: left Room 0 (The Off Licence, #R$C000); right Room 54 (West  Wing,
; #R$F600); up Room 57 (Above the West Bedroom, #R$F900); down Room 53 (Back
; Door, #R$F500).
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $1E (at $A0F0) start $8B; slot 1: definition
; $33 (at $A198) start $4E. List ends at slot 2 ($FF).
@label=RoomWestBedroom
b$F700 DEFB $00,$00,$04,$00,$A0,$40,$00,$00 ; row 0: ..........-.....##..-...........
 $F708 DEFB $00,$00,$00,$00,$A0,$40,$00,$00 ; row 1: ................##..-...........
